# Data lake (large, not committed). Anchored to the repo root (`/data/`, not `data/`) --
# an unanchored `data/` pattern also matched `src/data/`, the real source-code package
# (datalake/, features/, ingest/), silently excluding it from every commit since the first one.
# Confirmed via `git check-ignore -v` / `git ls-tree`: those files existed on disk (visible to
# the bind-mounted local dev container) but were never actually tracked by git, so a real
# GitHub Actions checkout never had them -- the true cause of a mypy "Cannot find implementation
# or library stub for module named src.data.datalake.query" failure that never reproduced
# locally, discovered only by comparing checked-file counts between a local mypy run (122 files)
# and the real CI log (110 files).
/data/
*.parquet
*.duckdb

# REL-007 E7.6: self-signed dev TLS CA + server cert/key, generated locally by
# scripts/generate_dev_tls_cert.py -- private key material must never be committed.
/certs/

